    println("  color_bg (fg -> bg conversion: 30..37 -> 40..47, 90..97 -> 100..107)")
    println("  ColorStyle builder: cstyle_new().fg(RED).bg(BLACK).bold().underline() (method chaining)")
    println("  ColorStyle builder: cstyle_fg/cstyle_bg/cstyle_bold/... (free-function form, parity)")
    println("  cstyle_to_sgr at every level (truecolor / 256 / basic / none) with down-sampling")
    println("  RGB down-sampling: rgb_to_xterm256 (cube + gray), rgb_to_basic_sgr, xterm256_to_basic_sgr")
    println("  color_downsample (manual: Rgb -> 256 -> basic -> none, monotone)")
    println("  color_render / color_print / color_println (convenience wrappers)")
    println("  color_reset_sgr (\\x1b[0m)")
    println("  Detection: color_detect() reads NO_COLOR / FORCE_COLOR / CLICOLOR_FORCE / COLORTERM / TERM")
    println("  Detection: color_detect_from(...) pure form (differential-safe; explicit env values)")
    println("  Bridge: cstyle_to_basic_style(cs) -> std.tui Style (down-samples RGB/256 to basic)")
